  m_text: Wisdom determines a character's knowledge, curiosity, and introspection.
    Wise characters have an inherent appetite for mystery which propels them to always
    be on the hunt for ways to better themselves. Their tendancy for self betterment
    leads them to hone their bodies as well as the mind, keeping fit and ready for
    when conflict becomes inevitable. Will you use your knowledge to better those
    around you? Or will you teach the ignorant that they are right to fear the Wise.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0df13e2d0e0fcee4ebfaa720a9ee5729, type: 2}
